Language English

// this is run during the Mythos phase while they
// are killing cultists

Book MythosFeedGate Ordered No Keep
	Triggered By @Ritual If goal = goalFeedGate And firstRitual = firstRitualOver
	
	Page Init
		Text """
			Sarah looks at you and says, <<It is too late to stop Matthias
			from opening the gate. But he doesn't have an elder sign, so he is
			not able to stabilize it. He needs a steady stream of the
			willing to sacrifice themselves to keep the gate open.

			<<The cultists you have seen gathering are here to sacrifice
			themselves. You must kill them,>> she says loudly. Your friends turn
			to look at her. <<You must kill them all.>>
			
			As she speaks, Matthias notices you for the first time.
			A look of worry crosses his face, but only for a moment. He returns
			to his summoning.
		"""
		
		feederKillCount = 0
		feederKillGoal = (#heros - exploredBackyardNicely) * 3 + 2
		
		Trigger @StartFeeders
	End Page
		
	Page Sacrifice
		Text """
			Matthias raises his arms, dagger and chalice in hand. He continues
			speaking words you do not understand, but it is clear he is focused
			on the gate, attempting to call the Ancient One.
			The room pulses with power, overwhelming you for a moment. You
			snap back to awareness as another cultist approaches. You steady yourself
			for another attack.
			
			The power you feel sputters with instability. With these cultists
			as sacrifice, the gate will remain open; without them, it will
			surely collapse.
		"""
	End Page Sacrifice
	
	Page Hurry
		Text """
			Sarah whispers, <<We must hurry. He is summoning his god. I can
			feel it responding.>>
			
			The chamber continues to vibrate with both the energy
			of the gate and Matthias's casting.
		"""
	End Page Hurry
	
	Page Ponder
		Text """
			You stop for a moment and wonder, <i>How many cultists do we have
			to kill? We've already killed {feederKillCount}.</i> Out of
			the corner of your eye you see another one coming. It's time to get
			back to work.
		"""
	End Page Ponder
	
	Page KeepGoing 
		Text """
			The ground stops vibrating for a moment. When it starts again, it
			is weaker, but still powerful.
			
			<<What you are doing is working,>> Sarah whispers. <<Keep going. I
			think we're close.>>
		"""
	End Page KeepGoing
	
	
	Loop Random
	
	Page RunningOutOfTime Random
		Text """
			<<Hurry,>> Sarah whispers. <<The gate is still open and we are
			running out of time.>>
		"""
	End Page RunningOutOfTime
	
	Page ItsComing Random
		Text """
			<<Please,>> Sarah begs, <<It is almost here.>>
		"""
	End Page ItsComing
	
	Page ItsHere Random
		Text """
			<<I can feel It. It is here. We may already be too late.>>
		"""
	End Page ItsHere
	
	Page SarahTransports
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @AnotherRequirementCompleted If goal = goalFeedGate And foundDagger And dvmFinished And journalFinished And foundElderSign And exploredDungeonCell And exploredCryptViaChapel And exploredDungeonCaveViaBasement
		
		Text """
			Sarah smiles for the first time and says out load, <<That's it! Now
			we know what is going on, where it's happening, and what to do about
			it. I think I can take us where we need to be.>>
			
			Sarah seems to grow, getting more transparent as she does. Suddenly, the world
			shifts and you are... somewhere else. And disoriented. There is
			noise and light and someone yelling. Folks are rushing by. It all
			seems far away.>>
		"""
		
		If firstRitual < firstRitualWoman Call MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.Woman
		If firstRitual < firstRitualOpenGate Call MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.OpenGate
		
		firstRitual = firstRitualOver
		Trigger @ExploreAltarViaSarah
		Goto PlaceSarah
	End Page SarahTransports
	
	Page PlaceSarah
		Not Visible
		
		Text """
			Sarah drifts away from you and settles. Move Sarah from your 
			investigator card to the board as indicated.
			
			She says loud enough that the people on the other side of the hole
			in the wall can hear her, <<I'm going to stay here and watch over
			what is happening. If you need to come into the cell or go back 
			to the house, call me and I will help.
		"""
		
		Goto Init
	End Page PlaceSarah
	
	Page CallSarah
		Text """
			I hear you calling me. What do you need?
		"""
		Button 1 "{action} Bring me into the cell."
		Button 2 "{action} Take me through the hole in the wall."
		
		If selection = 1 Then Goto CallSarahToCell
		Goto CallSarahToHouse
	End Page CallSarah
	
	Page CallSarahToCell
		Text """
			Sarah comes to you and starts to grow like she did before. You grow
			and become transparent with her then... you are overwhelmed for a
			moment but quickly regain your senses.
			
			Move your investigator figure to Sarah's space in the altar room.
		"""
	End Page CallSarahToCell
	
	Page CallSarahToHouse
		Text """
			Sarah grows large and transparent, pulling you into her swirling smoke.
			You are briefly disoriented, but knowing what is happening allows you
			to quickly adjust.
			
			Move your investigator figure to the dungeon cell.
		"""
	End Page CallSarahToHouse
	
End Book MythosFeedGate


Book MythosFeeders Ordered No Keep // no looping, so each page is one-and-done
	/*	How This Works
	
		Feeders are cultists who sacrifice themselves to keep the gate open.
	
		On startup, a number of feeders are spawned and a message is displayed
		showing how many and where they are.
		
		feederSpawnPosition is where the feeders spawn. It starts at 7 which
		is in the torture chamber. Each sight token that is breached moves the
		spawn point back. This is the list of spawn points and their position
		nunmber.
			7	torture chamber
			6	dungeon cave
			4	crypt
			1	chapel
			
		The 'feeder' variable refers to the currently selected feeder. There
		are no arrays, so feeder 1 keeps its values in feeder1whateve. These
		are the values tracked.
			
			feederN			True if this feeder is active
			feederPosition	Which token represents its position
			feederSpawn		Which CustomMonster is used for this one, from 1-6
			
		When the Mythos phase starts, the feeder variable is set to 0. As
		each one is activated, Movefeeder directs movement and increments
		feeder so the next one can be handled for the next activated feeder
		monster.
		
		When one is defeated, there are a set of methods here that catch that
		specific monster's trigger and removes it.
		
		After reach defeat, @FeederDefeated fires so a count can be tracked.
	*/
	
	Page StartFeeders
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @StartFeeders
		No Text
		
		feederPosition = 8
		
		feederMax = #heros + 1 - exploredBackyardNicely
		feederKillTarget = feederMax * 3 + 1
		Call AddFeeders
	End Page StartFeeders

	Page Spawn
		No Text
		
		If feederSpawn = 1 Then Call Event SpawnFeeder1
		If feederSpawn = 2 Then Call Event SpawnFeeder2
		If feederSpawn = 3 Then Call Event SpawnFeeder3
		If feederSpawn = 4 Then Call Event SpawnFeeder4
		If feederSpawn = 5 Then Call Event SpawnFeeder5
		If feederSpawn = 6 Then Call Event SpawnFeeder6
	End Page Spawn

	Page Move
		Triggered By @ActiviateFeeder
		
		Call LoadFeeder
		
		If feederPosition = 9 Then Goto Sacrifice
		
		feederStart = feederPosition

		// we call this twice; this shows where it is coming from
		Call ShowFeeder
		
		distance = Random(2) + (1 - exploredBackyardNicely)
		feederPosition = feederPosition + distance
		If feederPosition > 9 Then feederPosition = 9

		// now that it's moved, we show its new place
		Call ShowFeeder
		
		If feederStart <= 8 And feederPosition > 8 Then Goto GoThroughHole
		
		Text """
			Move the cultist toward the dungeon cell as indicated. He is in a
			hurry, so he does not stop when passing investigators.
		"""
		
		If Not exploredBackyardNicely And openGateFirstFeeder And distance > 1 Then Text """
			As the cultist passes he mutters something about Benjamin and maybe
			the words 'backyard gate'? He moves a little faster. Move the cultist toward
			the dungeon cell as indicated. He is in a hurry so he does not stop
			when passing invenstigators.
			
			You wonder, <i>Why do these men even know about the broken gate? Are the
			folks here really that petty?</i>
		"""

		If Not exploredBackyardNicely And feedGateFirstFeeder And distance > 1 Then feedGateFirstFeeder = false
		
		Button 1 "There is an investigator in this space"
		Button 2 "There is no investigator in this space"
		
		Call Hidefeeder
		
		If selection = 1 Then Goto Attack
	End Page Move

	Page Attack
		Call ShowFeeder
		
		option = RANDOM(3)
		
		Text """
			The cultist turns to look at you briefly. He is in too much of a
			hurry to stop so he keeps going.
		"""

		If option = 2 Then Text """
			Choose a random investigator in the cultist's space.
			
			The cultist rears up, pulls a knife, and heads toward you. You have
			to move quickly ({agility}+1;2).
			
			If you pass, his knife passes far to your left.
			
			If you fail, the knife cuts into you. Take 1 damage ({agility}
			negates).
		"""
		
		If option = 3 Then Text """
			Choose a random investigator in the cultist's space.

			The cultist turns and continues running, now directly at you. He
			puts his head down, grabs you around the middle, and pushes you into
			the wall behind you. Become Dazed.
			
			The cultist dosen't fare well either. The cultist takes 1 damage.
		"""
		
		Call HideFeeder
	End Page Attack
	
	Page GoThroughHole
		If feederThroughHoleAlready Then Text """
			The cultist continues running. He is in a hurry, so he doesn't
			stop when passing investigators.
			
			He pours through the hole in the wall like the ones before him,
			appearing near the gate.
			
			Move the cultist as indicated.
		"""
		
		Text """
			The cultist continues running. He is in a hurry, so he doesn't
			stop when passing investigators.
			
			In the cell, he stops for a moment and mutters
			something under his breath. He grows taller and thinner, then
			transparent. Suddenly, his body swirls like smoke and disappears
			through the hole in the wall. He appears on the other side near 
			the gate.
			
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} looks up as the cultist pours out of the
			hole in the wall, solidifies, and looks around. While briefly dazed,
			the man quickly gets his bearings and walks toward the gate.
			
			Move the cultist as indicated.
			
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator} returns to his work.
		"""
		
		feederThroughHoleAlready = true
		Call SaveFeeder
	End Page GoThroughHole

	Page Sacrifice
		Text """
			The cultist draws a knife, mumbles something, slits has throat, and
			falls to the ground. Rather than pooling, his blood drips upward,
			somehow feeding the gate. When the blood runs out, the cultist's 
			body grows transparent again, but this time the swirl of smoke
			drifts up and is swallowed by the gate.
			
			Remove the cultist from the board.
		"""
		
		If feederSacrifiedAlready Then Text """
			Like those before him, the feeder slits his throat and disappears.
			The gate continues humming, stable for now.
			
			Remove the cultist from the board.
		"""
		
		feederSacrificedAlready = true
		Call RemoveFeeder
	End Page Sacrifice

	Page Evade
		Triggered By @EvadeFeeder
		
		If RANDOM(3) = 3 Then Goto EvadeHarsh
		
		Text """
			He is in a hurry and seems to be trying to evade you.
		"""
		
		If RANDOM(3) = 3 Then 
		

	End Page Evade

	Page EvadeHarsh
		extraDice = exploredBackyardNicely ? 2 : 1

		Text """
			As you try to walk around him, the man pulls a knife and approaches you.
			
			Test {agility}
			
			Add {var:extraDice} extra die if you are not wounded.
		"""

		Test Quota 2 Set isPass
		If isPass Goto EvadeHarshPass
		Goto EvadeHarshFail
	End Page EvadeHarsh

	Page EvadeHarshPass
		option = RANDOM(3)
		
		Text """
			At the last minute, the cultist decides you are not important enough
			to waste time on and lets you go.
		"""
		
		If option = 1 Then Text """
			He takes a stab at you but you twist and avoid his blade. He's in a
			hurry, so one try was enough and he continues runnig toward the
			altar.
		"""
		
		If option = 2 Then Text """
			You do this weird attack a friend showed you that puts the cultist
			on the ground. Hard. The cultist takes 2 damage.
		"""
	End Page EvadeHarshPass
	
	Page EvadeHarshFail
		option = RANDOM(3)
		
		Text """
			At the last minute, the cultist decides you are not important enough
			to waste time on and lets you go.		
		"""
		
		If option = 1 Then Text """
			He takes a stab at you but you twist and avoid his blade... until he
			comes back around. You look down and see blood. Take 1 damage
			({strength} negates).
		"""
		
		If option = 2 Then Text """
			You do this weird attack a friend showed you that puts the cultist
			on the ground. Hard. The cultist takes 2 damage.

			Unfortunately, you didn't do the move correctly and feel something
			stinging in your right leg. Lose your action.
		"""
	End Page EvadeHarshFail


	Page HorrorCheck
		Text """
			It's just a man in robes. Aside from his fervency and death wish,
			he just isn't that scary.
		"""
		
		If Random(3) = 1 Then Text """
			It's just a man in robes. He isn't that scary.
			
			Suddenly he turns and meets your gaze. He is mad with fervency, his
			eyes are hypnotic. He approaches you and you are unable to
			look away. The terror is building. You know you have to look away,
			but... ({will}+1;2)
			
			If you pass, you pull your eyes away and he loses interest. The
			man turns back and resumes his trek toward the altar.
			
			If you fail, he holds your gaze until he slashes at your arm with
			his knife, then he turns and walks away. When he breaks eye contact,
			you are left with your terror and a new injury. Take 1 damage and 1
			horror ({strength}+1 negates).
		"""
	
	End Page HorrorCheck

	Page Removefeeder
		// we remove one by copying later values over this one
		If feeder < 2 Then feeder1 = feeder2
		If feeder < 2 Then feeder1position = feeder2position
		If feeder < 2 Then feeder1spawn = feeder2spawn
		
		If feeder < 3 Then feeder2 = feeder3
		If feeder < 3 Then feeder2position = feeder3position
		If feeder < 3 Then feeder2spawn = feeder3spawn

		If feeder < 4 Then feeder3 = feeder4
		If feeder < 4 Then feeder3position = feeder4position
		If feeder < 2 Then feeder3spawn = feeder4spawn
		
		If feeder < 5 Then feeder4 = feeder5
		If feeder < 5 Then feeder4position = feeder5position
		If feeder < 5 Then feeder4spawn = feeder5spawn
		
		If feeder < 6 Then feeder5 = feeder6
		If feeder < 6 Then feeder5position = feeder6position
		If feeder < 6 Then feeder5spawn = feeder6spawn
		
		feeder6 = false
		feeder6position = 0
		feeder6spawn = 0
		
		If feederSpawn = 1 Then Remove Spawnfeeder1
		If feederSpawn = 2 Then Remove Spawnfeeder2
		If feederSpawn = 3 Then Remove Spawnfeeder3
		If feederSpawn = 4 Then Remove Spawnfeeder4
		If feederSpawn = 5 Then Remove Spawnfeeder5
		If feederSpawn = 6 Then Remove Spawnfeeder6
		
		// there is one fewer now
		feederCount = feederCount - 1
		
		// we removed the current one, so back up so we don't
		// miss the next one
		feeder = feeder - 1

		No Text
	End Page Removefeeder
	
	Page AddFeeder
		No Text
		
		If Not feeder6 Then feeder = 6
		If not feeder5 Then feeder = 5
		If not feeder4 Then feeder = 4
		If not feeder3 Then feeder = 3
		If not feeder2 Then feeder = 2
		If not feeder1 Then feeder = 1
		
		If feeder = 1 Then feeder1 = true
		If feeder = 2 Then feeder2 = true
		If feeder = 3 Then feeder3 = true
		If feeder = 4 Then feeder4 = true
		If feeder = 5 Then feeder5 = true
		If feeder = 6 Then feeder6 = true
		
		Call GetFreeSpawnNumber
		Call Spawn
		Call SaveFeeder
		
		feederCount = feederCount + 1
	End Page AddFeeder
	
	Page Savefeeder
		No Text
		
		If feeder = 1 Then feeder1position = feederPosition
		If feeder = 1 Then feeder1Spawn = feederSpawn
		
		If feeder = 2 Then feeder2position = feederPosition
		If feeder = 2 Then feeder2Spawn = feederSpawn
		
		If feeder = 3 Then feeder3position = feederPosition
		If feeder = 3 Then feeder3Spawn = feederSpawn
		
		If feeder = 4 Then feeder4position = feederPosition
		If feeder = 4 Then feeder4Spawn = feederSpawn
		
		If feeder = 5 Then feeder5position = feederPosition
		If feeder = 5 Then feeder5Spawn = feederSpawn
		
		If feeder = 6 Then feeder6position = feederPosition
		If feeder = 6 Then feeder6Spawn = feederSpawn
	End Page Savefeeder
	
	Page LoadFeeder
		No Text
		
		If feeder = 1 Then feederPosition = feeder1position
		If feeder = 1 Then feederSpawn = feeder1spawn
		
		If feeder = 2 Then feederPosition = feeder2position
		If feeder = 2 Then feederSpawn = feeder2spawn
		
		If feeder = 3 Then feederPosition = feeder3position
		If feeder = 3 Then feederSpawn = feeder3spawn
		
		If feeder = 4 Then feederPosition = feeder4position
		If feeder = 4 Then feederSpawn = feeder4spawn
		
		If feeder = 5 Then feederPosition = feeder5position
		If feeder = 5 Then feederSpawn = feeder5spawn
		
		If feeder = 6 Then feederPosition = feeder6position
		If feeder = 6 Then feederSpawn = feeder6spawn
	End Page LoadFeeder
	
	Page LoadFeederBySpawn
		No Text
		
		If feeder1 And feeder1spawn = feederSpawn Then feeder = 1
		If feeder2 And feeder2spawn = feederSpawn Then feeder = 2
		If feeder3 And feeder3spawn = feederSpawn Then feeder = 3
		If feeder5 And feeder4spawn = feederSpawn Then feeder = 4
		If feeder5 And feeder5spawn = feederSpawn Then feeder = 5
		If feeder6 And feeder6spawn = feederSpawn Then feeder = 6
		Call LoadFeeder
	End Page LoadFeederBySpawn
	
	Page ShowFeeder
		No Text
		
		If feederPosition = 1 Then Add TokenFeeder1!
		If feederPosition = 2 Then Add TokenFeeder2!
		If feederPosition = 3 Then Add Tokenfeeder3!
		If feederPosition = 4 Then Add TokenFeeder4!
		If feederPosition = 5 Then Add TokenFeeder5!
		If feederPosition = 6 Then Add TokenFeeder6!
		If feederPosition = 7 Then Add TokenFeeder7!
		If feederPosition = 8 Then Add TokenFeeder8!
		If feederPosition = 9 Then Add TokenFeeder9!
	End Page ShowFeeder
	
	Page HideFeeder
		No Text
		
		Remove TokenFeeder1, TokenFeeder2, TokenFeeder3, TokenFeeder4, TokenFeeder5, TokenFeeder6, TokenFeeder7, TokenFeeder8, TokenFeeder9
	End Page HideFeeder
	
	Page Feeder1Dies
		Triggered By @DefeatedSpawnFeeder1
		No Text
		
		feederSpawn = 1
		Call LoadBySpawn
		Call RemoveFeeder
		
		Trigger @FeederKilled
	End Page Feeder1Dies
	
	Page Feeder2Dies
		Triggered By @DefeatedSpawnFeeder2
		No Text
		
		feederSpawn = 2
		Call LoadBySpawn
		Call RemoveFeeder
		
		Trigger @FeederKilled
	End Page Feeder2Dies
	
	Page Feeder3Dies
		Triggered By @DefeatedSpawnFeeder3
		No Text
		
		feederSpawn = 3
		Call LoadBySpawn
		Call RemoveFeeder
		
		Trigger @FeederKilled
	End Page Feeder3Dies
	
	Page Feeder4Dies
		Triggered By @DefeatedSpawnFeeder4
		No Text
		
		feederSpawn = 4
		Call LoadBySpawn
		Call RemoveFeeder
		
		Trigger @FeederKilled
	End Page Feeder4Dies
	
	Page Feeder5Dies
		Triggered By @DefeatedSpawnFeeder5
		No Text
		
		feederSpawn = 5
		Call LoadBySpawn
		Call RemoveFeeder
		
		Trigger @FeederKilled
	End Page Feeder5Dies
	
	Page Feeder6Dies
		Triggered By @DefeatedSpawnFeeder6
		No Text
		
		feederSpawn = 6
		Call LoadBySpawn
		Call RemoveFeeder
		
		Trigger @FeederKilled
	End Page Feeder6Dies
	
	Page GetFreeSpawnNumber
		No Text
		
		feederNextSpawn = 1

		// If 1 is taken, bump to 2
		If feederNextSpawn = 1 And feeder1 And feeder1spawn = 1 Then feederNextSpawn = 2
		If feederNextSpawn = 1 And feeder2 And feeder2spawn = 1 Then feederNextSpawn = 2
		If feederNextSpawn = 1 And feeder3 And feeder3spawn = 1 Then feederNextSpawn = 2
		If feederNextSpawn = 1 And feeder4 And feeder4spawn = 1 Then feederNextSpawn = 2
		If feederNextSpawn = 1 And feeder5 And feeder5spawn = 1 Then feederNextSpawn = 2
		If feederNextSpawn = 1 And feeder6 And feeder6spawn = 1 Then feederNextSpawn = 2

		// If 2 is taken, bump to 3
		If feederNextSpawn = 2 And feeder1 And feeder1spawn = 2 Then feederNextSpawn = 3
		If feederNextSpawn = 2 And feeder2 And feeder2spawn = 2 Then feederNextSpawn = 3
		If feederNextSpawn = 2 And feeder3 And feeder3spawn = 2 Then feederNextSpawn = 3
		If feederNextSpawn = 2 And feeder4 And feeder4spawn = 2 Then feederNextSpawn = 3
		If feederNextSpawn = 2 And feeder5 And feeder5spawn = 2 Then feederNextSpawn = 3
		If feederNextSpawn = 2 And feeder6 And feeder6spawn = 2 Then feederNextSpawn = 3

		// If 3 is taken, bump to 4
		If feederNextSpawn = 3 And feeder1 And feeder1spawn = 3 Then feederNextSpawn = 4
		If feederNextSpawn = 3 And feeder2 And feeder2spawn = 3 Then feederNextSpawn = 4
		If feederNextSpawn = 3 And feeder3 And feeder3spawn = 3 Then feederNextSpawn = 4
		If feederNextSpawn = 3 And feeder4 And feeder4spawn = 3 Then feederNextSpawn = 4
		If feederNextSpawn = 3 And feeder5 And feeder5spawn = 3 Then feederNextSpawn = 4
		If feederNextSpawn = 3 And feeder6 And feeder6spawn = 3 Then feederNextSpawn = 4

		// If 4 is taken, bump to 5
		If feederNextSpawn = 4 And feeder1 And feeder1spawn = 4 Then feederNextSpawn = 5
		If feederNextSpawn = 4 And feeder2 And feeder2spawn = 4 Then feederNextSpawn = 5
		If feederNextSpawn = 4 And feeder3 And feeder3spawn = 4 Then feederNextSpawn = 5
		If feederNextSpawn = 4 And feeder4 And feeder4spawn = 4 Then feederNextSpawn = 5
		If feederNextSpawn = 4 And feeder5 And feeder5spawn = 4 Then feederNextSpawn = 5
		If feederNextSpawn = 4 And feeder6 And feeder6spawn = 4 Then feederNextSpawn = 5

		// If 5 is taken, bump to 6
		If feederNextSpawn = 5 And feeder1 And feeder1spawn = 5 Then feederNextSpawn = 6
		If feederNextSpawn = 5 And feeder2 And feeder2spawn = 5 Then feederNextSpawn = 6
		If feederNextSpawn = 5 And feeder3 And feeder3spawn = 5 Then feederNextSpawn = 6
		If feederNextSpawn = 5 And feeder4 And feeder4spawn = 5 Then feederNextSpawn = 6
		If feederNextSpawn = 5 And feeder5 And feeder5spawn = 5 Then feederNextSpawn = 6
		If feederNextSpawn = 5 And feeder6 And feeder6spawn = 5 Then feederNextSpawn = 6

		// If 6 is taken, none available => 0
		If feederNextSpawn = 6 And feeder1 And feeder1spawn = 6 Then feederNextSpawn = 0
		If feederNextSpawn = 6 And feeder2 And feeder2spawn = 6 Then feederNextSpawn = 0
		If feederNextSpawn = 6 And feeder3 And feeder3spawn = 6 Then feederNextSpawn = 0
		If feederNextSpawn = 6 And feeder4 And feeder4spawn = 6 Then feederNextSpawn = 0
		If feederNextSpawn = 6 And feeder5 And feeder5spawn = 6 Then feederNextSpawn = 0
		If feederNextSpawn = 6 And feeder6 And feeder6spawn = 6 Then feederNextSpawn = 0	
	End Page GetFreeSpawnNumber
	
	Page FeederDefeated
		feederKillCount = feederKillCount + 1
		If feederKillCount >= feederKillTarget Then Goto Done
		
		No Text
	End Page FeederDefeated
	
	Page Done
		No Text
		
		// if we are clearing it here, it is a full win
		outcome = gameWin
		Trigger @GameOver
	End Page Done
	
	Page AddFeeders
		Triggered By @EndRound If goal = goalFeedGate And firstRitual = firstRitualOver And feederCount < feederMax
		
		feedersAdded = feederMax - feederCount
		
		If feederCount < feederMax Then Call AddFeeder
		If feederCount < feederMax Then Call AddFeeder
		If feederCount < feederMax Then Call AddFeeder
		If feederCount < feederMax Then Call AddFeeder
		If feederCount < feederMax Then Call AddFeeder
		If feederCount < feederMax Then Call AddFeeder
		
		Call ShowFeeder
		
		If Not feedersAlreadyAdded Then Text """
			A group of cultists flood into the torture chamber. They are quiet
			and moving quickly. Place {var:feedersAdded} cultists as indicated.
		"""
		
		Text """
			The cultists just keep coming. Place {var:feedersAdded} cultists
			as indicated.
		"""
		
		Call HideFeeder
		feedersAlreadyAdded = true
	End Page AddFeeders
End Book MythosFeeders